			"notes": "**New Features & Improvements:**\n* Dummies now dynamically load their current chunk to prevent despawning when players leave the camera view\n* The normal Monitor now shares the UI of the enchanted version but is restricted to a 500-block range and the same dimension\n* The camera now seamlessly tracks targets as they travel through portals and across different dimensions\n* Added a brief blackout effect when returning from custom dimensions to smoothly hide teleport delays\n* Implemented a crash-recovery login guard to safeguard and recover active sessions after unexpected disconnects\n* The camera session now safely tracks targets via their UUID and aborts cleanly upon server disconnects\n\n**Bugfixes:**\n* Fixed an issue where various items and text elements were displayed in the wrong language\n* Fixed a visual bug that caused observed players to flicker for a single tick when toggling the camera\n* Stopped the \"Exit with: Shift\" overlay text from briefly flashing again after its fade-out animation\n* Prevented the game from wrongly teleporting observers to their bed or world spawn when leaving modded dimensions"
		},
